(7378633, 1158436, 138630, '<td valign="top">Oh, very nice.  I love the way the scene and figure through the screen looks like a needlepoint waiting to be worked.  The glimpses through the crack of the open door and the slots on the left are nice, too.  I could use a it more on the left and a bit less on the right, I think.</td>', 'Oh, very nice.  I love the way the scene and figure through the screen looks like a needlepoint waiting to be worked.  The glimpses through the crack of the open door and the slots on the left are nice, too.  I could use a it more on the left and a bit less on the right, I think.', '2015-07-01 01:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
