(7379086, 1158781, 103142, '<td valign="top">Ok -- I''m jealous that people are posting so much bling in the posthumous thread. So I''m restarting the bluebirds. I decided they would be for the photos that shout out to me on my very first time looking through a challenge. This one made me say "oh wow!" out loud, when only the cats were around to hear me. Nicely done!<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=811107" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_811107.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Ok -- I''m jealous that people are posting so much bling in the posthumous thread. So I''m restarting the bluebirds. I decided they would be for the photos that shout out to me on my very first time looking through a challenge. This one made me say "oh wow!" out loud, when only the cats were around to hear me. Nicely done! ', '2015-07-01 12:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
