(7379563, 1158487, 49480, '<td valign="top">I want to like this more, but I''m confused by what the subject is.  If the lighthouse placed at the left third, it''s too dark and my eye keeps being drawn to the sun.</td>', 'I want to like this more, but I''m confused by what the subject is.  If the lighthouse placed at the left third, it''s too dark and my eye keeps being drawn to the sun.', '2015-07-01 22:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
