(7385810, 1157461, 25024, '<td valign="top">I would be happy to draw and comment on this through the critique club if given it, so I will comment on it anyway, hope you don''t mind.<br/> <br/>The foreground bike is obviously the one you have selected for the thirds with its windshield nicely placed on the hotspot. There is deliberate over exposure hence the title, most of us will avoid it like the plague but it is very effective here in helping to emphasise the foreground. You also have some blocking in the shadows which again might be deliberate in blending two extremes together?<br/> <br/>I commend you for having the courage of your convictions, the image has a special appeal to you and you correctly anticipated a low score but stood by your choice, well done.</td>', 'I would be happy to draw and comment on this through the critique club if given it, so I will comment on it anyway, hope you don''t mind. The foreground bike is obviously the one you have selected for the thirds with its windshield nicely placed on the hotspot. There is deliberate over exposure hence the title, most of us will avoid it like the plague but it is very effective here in helping to emphasise the foreground. You also have some blocking in the shadows which again might be deliberate in blending two extremes together? I commend you for having the courage of your convictions, the image has a special appeal to you and you correctly anticipated a low score but stood by your choice, well done.', '2015-07-12 17:25:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(7386126, 1158729, 99075, '<td valign="top">Thanks a lot for your wonderful comments. I am so thrilled that this image broke my personal record.. :)</td>', 'Thanks a lot for your wonderful comments. I am so thrilled that this image broke my personal record.. :)', '2015-07-13 01:40:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(7386189, 1158729, 62694, '<td valign="top">Boston = home.  Nicely done, congratulations!<br/></td>', 'Boston = home.  Nicely done, congratulations!', '2015-07-13 03:28:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(7386266, 1158707, 83149, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot, my pick for first.  Frankly, I don''t know how this didn''t score a 7.</td>', 'Fantastic shot, my pick for first.  Frankly, I don''t know how this didn''t score a 7.', '2015-07-13 09:09:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(7386958, 1158200, 122678, '<td valign="top">Boy, you are versatile, i would never have guessed this would have been yours.<br/>Gorgous image, Congratulations top 10.<br/>We''re up against your team in the next round. yikks... :)<br/></td>', 'Boy, you are versatile, i would never have guessed this would have been yours.Gorgous image, Congratulations top 10.We''re up against your team in the next round. yikks... :)', '2015-07-14 16:43:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(7387341, 1158600, 25024, '<td valign="top">*Hello from Sid and the Critique Club*<br/>Oh cor blimey, I''ve drawn my own image for critique! I didn''t realise that could happen, ah well...<br/> <br/>Well, I''ve certainly learnt a hard lesson from this to make sure I thoroughly check ALL the detail. Not only was this a rushed entry but I had thoroughly cleaned the sensor before going out so I didn''t even bother to check for sensor dust, I should have done because I changed lenses several times. No excuses, lesson learnt.</td>', '*Hello from Sid and the Critique Club*Oh cor blimey, I''ve drawn my own image for critique! I didn''t realise that could happen, ah well... Well, I''ve certainly learnt a hard lesson from this to make sure I thoroughly check ALL the detail. Not only was this a rushed entry but I had thoroughly cleaned the sensor before going out so I didn''t even bother to check for sensor dust, I should have done because I changed lenses several times. No excuses, lesson learnt.', '2015-07-15 10:25:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(7387419, 1157461, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club....<br/> <br/>I see that <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=25024" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">sidpixel</a> already gave you a critique. However commenting from the critique club (I was the lucky one to draw your shot) I will put my two cents in. <br/> <br/>I can see why it didn''t do well in voting. But you were expecting that. A shot like this would appeal to a small percentage of DPC voters. I personally think that it tells a story. Anyway I do like your shot for what it is and I am glad that you took this shot for you. Even though you knew in your heart that it would not be perceived well with the DPC community. Happy shooting.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club.... I see that  sidpixel already gave you a critique. However commenting from the critique club (I was the lucky one to draw your shot) I will put my two cents in.  I can see why it didn''t do well in voting. But you were expecting that. A shot like this would appeal to a small percentage of DPC voters. I personally think that it tells a story. Anyway I do like your shot for what it is and I am glad that you took this shot for you. Even though you knew in your heart that it would not be perceived well with the DPC community. Happy shooting.', '2015-07-15 11:58:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(7387438, 1158875, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club...<br/> <br/>This is a good quality b&amp;w. I''m not too crazy about the kids legs being wacked off though.I really like the stopped motion of the water from the water gun. Also your DOF is good and I like the subject matter. Looks like a good time. Happy shooting.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club... This is a good quality b&w. I''m not too crazy about the kids legs being wacked off though.I really like the stopped motion of the water from the water gun. Also your DOF is good and I like the subject matter. Looks like a good time. Happy shooting.', '2015-07-15 12:23:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(7387455, 1158037, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club...<br/> <br/>The 1st thing that jumps out at me is the lighting. It just seems off. I understand that this was at a music festival in a tent. The lighting can be hard to manage. I am sure that had an effect on your score. However, the subject is good and I like how you framed him into the shot using the microphone as "the rule of thirds". Happy shooting...</td>', 'Hello from the critique club... The 1st thing that jumps out at me is the lighting. It just seems off. I understand that this was at a music festival in a tent. The lighting can be hard to manage. I am sure that had an effect on your score. However, the subject is good and I like how you framed him into the shot using the microphone as "the rule of thirds". Happy shooting...', '2015-07-15 12:36:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(7387638, 1158879, 14476, '<td valign="top">fabulous photo.  good catch.</td>', 'fabulous photo.  good catch.', '2015-07-15 17:49:11.000000', NULL, 0),
